{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"切りました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとロングだったので、そろそろ変えたいなと思いばっさりと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2014/04/14/7433568/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもポニーテールもツインもできるし、たくさんアレンジできる長さです(＾ｰ^)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しばらくはこの長さを楽しもうと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また冬くらいになればロング復活するかな☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の全国握手会、体調不良により中断してしまい、たくさんの方に迷惑をかけてしまったこと、本当にすみませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう元気になって、ご飯もいっぱい食べてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はサプライズで松井玲奈さんも一緒に気づいたら片想いを披露したよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玲奈さん乃木坂の制服凄いお似合いでした♪( ´▽｀)嬉しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手は仲良しな真洋と一緒で楽しかった(＾ｰ^)ノわーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の乃木どこでは色々とすみませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのテロップには、さすがスタッフさんやりよるな〜と思った...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白石さんと黒石さん、どっちが好みですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"